<title>UK: Rugby assoc. gets nod on motorway site.</title>
<headline>Rugby assoc. gets nod on motorway site.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rugby Estates Plc said on Monday that its 50 percent owned associate ICP Properties had been awarded planning permission to develop a new service area.</p>
<p>It expected the scheme to have a value in excess of nine million stg when completed.</p>
<p>The service area is situated at Barton Park on the A1 in North Yorkshire, Northern England.</p>
<p>London Newsroom + 44 171 542 4019</p>
